# Optional: Override the PRANA API base URL.
# By default, client.ts automatically resolves:
# - Android Emulator -> http://10.0.2.2:8000
# - iOS Simulator / Web -> http://127.0.0.1:8000
# - Physical phone via LAN -> http://<YOUR_LAN_IP>:8000 (e.g., http://192.168.1.7:8000)
# - Physical phone via Tunnel -> your tunneled backend URL (e.g., via ngrok http 8000)
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.7:8000

